  "title": {
   "en": "Fertile Period Couple"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "가임기 부부"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Don't you ever think about sleeping together, just once?\"\n\n\"Seems you’ve forgotten this is a business marriage. Or do I just look cheap to you?\"\n\nIt was Seolyeong who brought it up right after the formal family meeting ended.\nShe knew it was a strategic marriage.\n\nTo her, marriage was an escape—and if possible, she wanted to get pregnant and meet her birth mother.\nIn the smoking room, Beomhyeon clicked his Zippo lighter while holding a cigarette in his mouth, then removed it to say:\n\n\"Couldn’t you see it as an extension of our business?\"\n\n\"And what kind of business trades in sperm?\""
  },
